 Introduction
 ~~~~~~~~~~~~
 User.Idx is a file containg the names of your users, 36 bytes each. If
 this file gets corrupted or destroyed, TechnoBBS will refuse to function
 properly.

 Recreate will create a valid User.Idx in the current directory. You can
 then replace your old BBS:User/User.Idx with the new one. You should make
 a backup of the original first, though.

 Usage: Recreate <highest user number>


